<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Akatecholonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa jhukutumbula jha Pauli kwa Akatecholonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Akatecholonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Akat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa jhukutumbula jha Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akatecholonike</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa jhukutumbula kwa Akatecholonike ikajhandikwe na ntenga Pauli mu chula jha 1:1. Pange baluwa jhenje ndi jhikibha jha kutumbula kujhandikwa na Pauli ihoto kubhehe chehemo jha Bibliya, pange jhenje ikajhandikwe mu chaka cha makome nhwano na limo pabhelwikwa njwe Yecho Kilichitu. Pauli akibha atamita ku Kolintu pajhandika baluwa jhukutumbu kwa lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu lya ku Tesolonike, lilongo lyenio lya bhando lilinnyeketii lyatumbulicha mu mwanja gwake gwa ubhele gwa kiutenga, Mahengo gha akatenga mu chula jha 17:1-10. Ijhandikwe mukitabo cha mahengo kubhehe lilongo lya bhando bhubhahobholela bhandina bhubhakibha na lihembuko lya Akayahude, na Akayunane ndi bhubhakibha bhamahele.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli akahotwijhe kuhighilika kwenio ku Tesolonike kwa machiko ghamahele pajhomolila kulitumbulicha lilongo lyenio lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu lya kwenio, yenio akatumite baluwa jhenje palongolo kwakangamalicha mwojho kwa bhubhakanyeketii Kilichitu bhubhabhii kwenio. Baluwa jhenje ibhii na mambu ghamahele ghangalengana, na ghabhii malaghilo twe gha pamonga ghighilangii chiipalwa kutama Akakilichitu. Pauli ichimulila mambu gha kuhika kwa Kilichitu kwa mala jha ubhele. Ibhonikine kwa bhando bhubhahobholela Kilichitu bha ku Tesolonike bhakibha na kilolo chakupala kumanya kwa nhwalo gwa lijambo lyenio. Pauli ichimulila lijhambu lya kuhika kwa Kilichitu kwa mala jha ubhele, kubhehe anda ndela jha kwatangatila bhatame kwa kunhalalicha Chapanga, mu chula jha 5:6-8.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli itumbuu baluwa jhake kwa kulijhambucha lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu na kunchenguu Chapanga kwa nhwalo gwabhe, mu chula jha 1.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ichimulila panane ya lihengo lyake, akahanganichwe na lilobhe lyampelikila Timocheyo, mu chula jha 2-3.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ipiya malaghilo chibhapalwa kwa bhando bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu bhatame kongo bhakamulile kihobholelo chabhe cha kuhika kwa Kilichitu mala jha ubhele, Mu chula jha 4:1-5:15.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ijhomolela mu baluwa jhake kwa kulijhambucha kabhele lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu, na kwalobholela bhubhahobholela bhoha nkate jha lilongo lyoha lilinnyeketii Kilichitu bhaichome baluwa jhenje mu chula jha 5:16-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Ne Pauli, Silwano na Timocheyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Tunnyandikila mangota lilongo lya bhando bha kwenio ku Tesolonike, bhubhabhii bhando bhake Chapanga Tate, na bha Bhambo Yecho Kilichitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Tunnyopa Chapanga ampeke umbone na uteeke.<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ughome na kihobholelo cha ku Tesolonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Ninchenguu Chapanga machiko ghoha kwa nhwalo gwino, na machiko ghoha putujhopa tunkomboka mangota. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Nhwalo palonge jha Chapanga Tate gwito, tukomboka mahengo ghino ghihuma mu kihobholelo chino na ghilangii upalo gwino, pumuhobhalela Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu kwa uhimbililo. <verse eid="1TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Makalongo bhito, twenga tumanye Chapanga ampahii na ahagwi kubhehe bhando bhake, <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>nhwalo Malobhe gha Mbone pughahikilila, ghakahikitii jhe kwa lilobhe tugha nambo helahela ikahikite kwa makakala gha Uhuke gwa Chapanga, kongo umanye njwe kubhehe lilobhe lyenio ndi lya uchakaka. Umanye kubhehe chitutamita pamonga na mangota, tukatamite mbone kuntangatii mangota. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Mangota mukatujhighe twenga na Bhambo. Pamonga na kung'ahichwa hake, mukapokii lilobhe lya kuhangana kuhumii kwa Uhuke gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Nhwalo mangota ndi nnandanikiho gwa kujhigwa kwa lilongo lya bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu lyoha lya ku Makedoniya nuku Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Nhwalo gwa kughagha kwino lilobhe lya Bhambo likajhenile chi kwenio ku Makedoniya nuku Akaya tugha, nambo kihobholelo chiminacho kwa Chapanga kijhenile poha. Yene kibhii jhe chukujhonjekeya. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Bhando bheniya bhilonge nhwalo gwa mwanja gwito putuntyangila, na chimpokila, na chimuilekita inyagho, na kunhengela Chapanga jwabhii chakaka na ghome,<verse eid="1TH 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>ngoheno tunnendelela Mwana gwake ahuluke kuhumii kunane kwa Chapanga, ndi Yecho, Chapanga akayokiche kuhumii kwa bhando bhubhawile, na jwenio atughombole mu lilaka lya Chapanga lilihika.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Lihengo lya Pauli kwenio ku Tesolonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Makalongo bhango mabhene umanye kubhehe kuntyangii kwito kukibha jhajhe jhe. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Nhwalo umanye chitulighitwa na kukanwa kwenio ku muche gwa ku Filipu kabula jha kuhika kwino ku Tesolonike. Pamonga na kubhehe ulikoko hake, Chapanga gwito akatutehi twatangachile bhando Malobhe gha Mbone changa ubhoghohe. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Kilebhe chitunchokolekeya kwino chi kilebhe chuwange amu mipangu jhanganandela, hilu nginyika kwa mundo jhojhoha. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Twenga tulonge ngita chapala Chapanga nhwalo jwenio atuhwene kubhehe twambone, akatupekiye lihengo lyenio lya kwatangachila Lilobhe lya Mbone. Yene tupai jhe kwahanganicha bhando, nambo tupala kunhalalicha Chapanga jwamanya miojho jhito ade nkate. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Chapanga gwito amanya lilobhe lende ndi lya uchakaka! Twenga tutumii jhe malobhe gha kupembelekeya hilu tutumii jhe malobhe gha kuchenjela hilu kupata ilebhe hino kwa kukihiya. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Tupaii jhe kutukwewa na bhando, amu na mangota, amu mundo jhojhoha, <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>pamonga na twenga kubhehe akatenga bha Kilichitu, tukapahii jhe kilebhe kuhumii kwino. Nambo twenga tukibha bhanuu pakate jhino ngita majhe pailela yana yake. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Tukampahi hake chi tu kunnete Malobhe gha Mbone kuhumii kwa Chapanga, nambo helahela kubhoha ughome gwito kwa nhwalo gwino mangota. Naha ndi upalo gwito chiubhii kwino! <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Makalongo bhango, mangota mikomboka putukibha tuhengita mahengo na kung'ahika kilo na muhe nhwalo tukoto kubhehe nhwigho kwa mundo jhojhoha pakate jhino putuntangachila Malobhe gha Mbone kuhumii kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="1TH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Chakaka mangota umanye, na Chapanga helahela chakaka amanye, tutamita nyahinyahi na tutamita kwa kujheketelwa na Chapanga na changaulemo pakate jhino. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Umanye kubhehe twenga tukantendii kila jhumo gwino ngita tate paitendela yana mundo jwenio. <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>Tukankangamaliche mwojho, tukampepiche na kumpwatalila, ntame ngita chapala Chapanga, jwankemita mme munahota nkolongwa jwa Chapanga na ung'alicho gwake.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Kabhele tubhii na nhwalo gwa kunnomba Chapanga machiko ghoha, putunneti Malobhe gha Mbone gha Chapanga, mangota mukajhohine na chi ngita malobhe gha bhando na yenio ndi chiibhile. Nhwalo Chapanga ahenga lihengo nkate jhino mangota bhunnyeketile. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Makalongo bhango, mangota ghughapitii kwa lilongo lya bhando bhubhannyeketii Kilichitu bha kola ku Yudeya, mambu ghighapiti bhando bhake Kilichitu Yecho. Mangota mukang'ahichwe na bhando bha kilambo chino anda bhene hele bhakang'ahitwe na Akayahude ajhabhe, <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>bhene ndi bhakankomite Bhambo Yecho na milondole bha Chapanga, na twenga bhakatung'ahite helahela. Bhando bhene bhajhakunchimwa Chapanga, kabhele likoko kwa kila mundo! <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Bhapalita kutuhibhilikiya kwatangachila bhando bha ilambo henge, malobhe gha ughombokeko. Naha ndi chibhalundika uhakaho gwabhe ade utwelele ghubhatehila machiko ghoha. Nambo ngohe lilaka lya Chapanga lyahulukile.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ipala kwatyangii kabhele bhando bha ku Tesolonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Makalongo bhango, tukalekine kwa machiko ghandina tugha, kabhele kulekana kwenio kukibha kwa yegha tugha na chi kwa uhuke. Machiko ghandina ghighahika, tukankombwike hake na tukaghaghite kumonengana kabhele! <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Yene tukalaghine kuntyangii kabhele. Ne Pauli, nikapahi kuhika kwino kabhele, nambo Limbembela ajhakutuhibhilikiya. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Bho, putupala kujhema palonge jha Bhambo Yecho papala kuhika, ndweko jha kuhoto kwito naibhaha nike? Mangota ndi lihobholelo lito na uhanganilo gwito. <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Chakaka, mangota ndi ung'alicho gwito na luhanganilo lwito.<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Kujhomolela tukahotwii jhe kuhimbilila. Yene tukahighilike kutama kanjika jhito ku Atene, <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>na kuntuma kwino nnongo gwito Timocheyo, jwakibha nhenga lihengo nnyito mulihengo lya Chapanga mukutangacha Malobhe gha Mbone gha Kilichitu. Tukantumite ankangamaliche na kunneke mwojho, <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>kupala kihobholelo cha mundo jhojhoha pakate jhino kikoto kutundangalila kwa nhwalo gwa malagho gheniya. Mangota umanye kubhehe tupalwa kung'ahika. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Putukibha pamonga na mangota, tukannobholile kubhehe naung'ahichwa, na anda chiumanye, yenio ndi chiipitile. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Ghono ndi nhwalo gwa kuntuma Timocheyo kwino. Nikahotwii jhe kuhimbilila kabhele, nintumite kupala manye malobhe gha kihobholelo chino. Nyogwipa Jwanganandela kunyigha na lihengo lituhengita pakate jhino lihobhole jhajhe!<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Nambo ngohe Timocheyo abhujhite kuhumii kwino, jwenio atulobholile malobhe gha kuhanganila gha kihobholelo chino na upalo gwino. Atulobholile kubhehe mutukomboka machiko ghoha, na mipala kukongana na twenga na twenga hele tubhii nakilolo chukukongana na mangota. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Bhahe, malobhe gha kihobholelo chino ghatukangamaliche mwojho mu malagho na mang'ahiko ghito ghoha, <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>nhwalo ngohe tutama chakaka, anda mangota nnyema nganganga mu kulombana na Bhambo. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Ngohe tuhoto kunnomba Chapanga gwito kwa nhwalo gwino. Tunnomba kwa luhanganilo lutubhinako palonge jhake kwa nhwalo gwino mangota. <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Tujhendelela kunnyopa Chapanga kilo na muhe kwa mwojho gwito ghoha tupala atupekeye pwache jha kukongana kabhele na tunnyyonjekeye chochoha chikipongwiye mu kihobholelo chino.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Tunnyopa Chapanga, Tate gwito, na Bhambo gwito Yecho, atulengenikii ndela jha kukongana na mangota. <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Bhambo anyonjekeye mapalano gha bhene kwa bhene na kwapala bhando bhoha, ngita twenga chitumpala mangota. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Yene naikangamalicha miojho jhino, mangota namma manga malemo namma manyahinyahi palonge jha Chapanga na Tate gwito, peniya Bhambo gwito Yecho papakuhika pamonga na bhando bhake bhoha.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kutama kwa kuhalalicha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Bhahe, makalongo bhango, mukibholite kubhoke kwito chimupalwa kutama kwa kunhalalicha Chapanga. Chakaka yenio ndi chimitama. Na ngohe tumpembelekeya kwa liina lya Bhambo Yecho nnyendelela kuhenga ghaumbone. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Nhwalo umanya ghala malaghalikilo ghitumpekii, tukampekiye kwa uhotolo gwa Bhambo Yecho. <verse eid="1TH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Chapanga apala mangota mme bhanyahinyahi na muileka kolwa ngongola. <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>Kila munalome amanye chapalwa kutama na nhwana mundo kwa unyahinyahi na ichima, <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>na chi kilanga ngita bhando bhange bhangammanya Chapanga. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Bhahe, mundo jhojhoha akoto kunnemuu jhonge amu angamponja jhe nnyake kupete lilobhe lende. Nhwalo Bhambo ndi jwahadabula bhando bhoha ngita chatulobholila na kunkelebhuya hake. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Nhwalo Chapanga atukemite jhe kuhenga ngongola, nambo tutame kwa unyahinyahi. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Yene mundo jhojhoha jwakana mabholo ghanga, ankana jhe mundo, nambo ankana Chapanga jwampekeya Uhuke gwake.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Kwa malobhe gha kupalana, tupala jhe kunnyandikila. Nhwalo mangota mabhene mmolitwe na Chapanga kupalana. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Nhwalo yenio ndi chimwatendela akalongo bhoha bhubhabhii kwenio ku Makedoniya jhoha. Nambo tumpembekeya hake nnyendelela kuhenga kuchocha peniya. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Ntamengane kwa kuhengwa, kila jhumo ahenga ilebhe yake jwenio, na ahenga lihengo kwa mabhoko ghake jwenio ngita chitunaghalikiye. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Kwa kuhenga yenio nanhobholeka na bhando bhangaumanya Kilichitu, na muhobhole jhe mundo jhojhoha nhwalo gwa ghala ghumipala.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwa Bhambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Makalongo bhito, tupala umanye uchakaka kwa lilobhe lya bhala bhubhawile, nkoto kubhehe na ungolongondi ngita bhando bhange bhangabhehe na lihobholelo. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Twenga tujheketela Yecho akawile na kuyoka, tujheketela Chapanga chabhaleta pamonga na Yecho kwa jwenio bhala bhoha bhubhawile kongo bhannyeketile Yecho.<verse eid="1TH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Ghanga ghutunnobholile ndi mabholo gha Bhambo, twenga bhitubhii ghome, bhituhighilike ade papala kuhika Bhambo, chakaka natwalongolela jhe bhala bhubhahwii njwe. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Nhwalo Bhambo jwenio nahuluka kuhumii kunane kwa Chapanga, abhii na nhwilo na lilobhe lya nhenga mahengo nkolongwa jwa Chapanga na lilobhe lya lipenenga lya Chapanga, na bhando bhubhawile kongo bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu nabhatumbula kuyoka. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Peniya twenga tubhii na ughome, bhituhighilike natutolwa pamonga nabho mu lihunde kukongana na Bhambo. Yene natutama na Bhambo machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Ngohe, mpepechane kwa malobhe ghanga.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Mpanganike kuhika kwa Bhambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Ngohe makalongo, tukibhona jhe chukunyandikila kwa malobhe gha kipinde na nchimo pighapa kupitila. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Nhwalo mangota umanye kubhehe lichiko papa kuhika Bhambo naibhaha ngita mwihe pahika kilo. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Bhando bhubhapala kulonge, “Kila kilebhe kibhii njelembo na uteeke,” papa kuhangabhana na kupwitikilila papala kwahikilila ngita lipyanda lya kupapa mwana na bhando nabhahoto jhe kubhambala. <verse eid="1TH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Nambo makalongo, mangota mmii jhe mulubhendo, na lichiko lyenio limpwitikilila ngita mwihe. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Mangota mabhoha ndi yana ya lumule na yana ya muhe. Twenga twabhando bha kilo jhe amu mulubhendo. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Bhahe, tukoto kugholoka ngita bhange, nambo tukeluwe na tukilongoche twabhete. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Nhwalo bhando bhubhagholoka, bhigholoka kilo, na bhala bhubhalobhela, bhilobhe kilo. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Nambo twenga bhitubhii bhando bha muhe tukilongoche twabhete. Tuhwale kihobholelo na upalo ngita ngobho jha choma jha kukikengelela munganga hito, na lihobholelo lya ughombokeko libhaha ngita kofiya jha choma jha kukikengelela mimuto jhito. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Nhwalo Chapanga akatuhagwii jhe tukomolekelwe na lilaka lyake, nambo tughombolelwe kupete Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Jwenio akahwii kwa nhwalo gwito, tutame nako pamonga na jwenio, tubhehe tuhwi amu ghome. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Ngohe nkangamalichane mwojho na kutangatilana, ngita chimuhenga ngohe.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ijhomolela kwa kwalaghalikiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Ngohe tumpembelekeya makalongo mwajheketele bhala bhubhahenga lihengo pakate jhino, bhunnongocha na bhibhannyemelela mu kulombana na Yecho Kilichitu. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Mwajhokanikiya hake na kwapala nhwalo gwa lihengo libhihenga. Ntame kwa uteeke.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Makalongo tumpembelekeya, mwakanikiye bhala bhubhabhii akatotoho, mwakangamaliche mwojho bhala bhibhajhoghopa, mwatangatile bhando bhibhaleghelike, mwahimbilile bhando bhoha. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Mukilolekehe mundo jhojhoha akoto kunepechela nnyake libhoho kwa libhoho, nambo machiko ghoha ntendelane ghamaha na helahela mwatendele bhando bhoha ghambone.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Uhangane machiko ghoha, <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>munnyope Chapanga changatotokela, <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>muchengule Chapanga kwa kila kilebhe, nhwalo yenio ndi chaipala Chapanga nhenge kwa kulombana kwino na Kilichitu Yecho.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Nkoto kuhibhilikiha lihengo lya Uhuke gwa Chapanga, <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>nkoto kulipucha lilobhe lilihuma kwa Chapanga, <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>nambo mughalingukihe mambu ghoha na mughakamule ghighabhii ghamaha. <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>Ntamangane kutale na ghanganandela ghoha.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Chapanga jwenio jwatupela uteeke ajhelebhule na ankengelele mangota mu uhuke na miojho jhino, na yegha jhino ibhonekana ikwetii jhe ulemo ghoghoha papakuhika Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Chapanga jwankemita mangota nahenga yenio nhwalo kwa uchakaka.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Makalongo, mutujhopela na twenga.<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Mwajhambuche akalongo bhoha kwa upalo.<verse eid="1TH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Ninaghalikiya kwa uhotolo gwa Bhambo, mwachomele akalongo bhito bhoha baluwa jhenje.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Umbone gwa Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu utama pamonga na mangota.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
